{"title": "Smile", "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"druid-infobox druid-container noexcerpt\" id=\"druid-container-1\"><div><div class=\"druid-title\">Smile</div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div class=\"druid-main-image\"><div class=\"druid-main-images-labels druid-tabs\"><div class=\"druid-main-images-label druid-tab druid-toggleable druid-title-tab focused\" data-druid=\"1-1\" data-druid-tab-key=\"In-Game\">In-Game</div></div><a href=\"/wiki/File:Smile.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Smile.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/Smile.jpg/250px-Smile.jpg?f1aee2\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"141\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Smile.jpg/375px-Smile.jpg?f1aee2 1.5x, /images/thumb/Smile.jpg/500px-Smile.jpg?f1aee2 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div data-druid-section=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-section druid-section-Information\">Information</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-VariantOf\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-VariantOf\">Variant Of</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-VariantOf druid-data-nonempty\">\nCoil-Head</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-InternalID\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-InternalID\">Internal ID</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-InternalID druid-data-nonempty\">\nDiscMan</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-MaxCount\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-MaxCount\">Max Count</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-MaxCount druid-data-nonempty\">\n2</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-PowerLevel\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-PowerLevel\">Power Level</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-PowerLevel druid-data-nonempty\">\n0.5</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-CauseofDeath\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-CauseofDeath\">Cause of Death</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-CauseofDeath druid-data-nonempty\">\nStrangulation</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-IsBodyRecoverable\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-IsBodyRecoverable\">Is Body Recoverable?</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-IsBodyRecoverable druid-data-nonempty\">\nYes</div></div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div data-druid-section=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-section druid-section-Stats\">Stats</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-Health\" data-druid-section-row=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-Health\">Health</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-Health druid-data-nonempty\">\nUnkillable</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-Damage\" data-druid-section-row=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-Damage\">Damage</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-Damage druid-data-nonempty\">\n90</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-DoorSpeedMultiplier\" data-druid-section-row=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-DoorSpeedMultiplier\">Door Speed Multiplier</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-DoorSpeedMultiplier druid-data-nonempty\">\n0.06</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-StunTimeMultiplier\" data-druid-section-row=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-StunTimeMultiplier\">Stun Time Multiplier</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-StunTimeMultiplier druid-data-nonempty\">\n3.25</div></div></div></div>\n<p>The <b>Smile</b> is a hostile entity and variant of the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://lethal.miraheze.org/wiki/Coil-Head\">Coil-Head</a> added by <b>Wesley's Ememy Variants</b>. It has a purple body resembling that of a large disc with two legs and feet. As its name implies, it also has a wide, toothy smile and two red eyes, staring at players.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Mechanics\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Mechanics\">&gt; Mechanics</span></h2>\n<p>Behaviorally, the <b>Smile</b> is very similar to the Coil-Head, having the same patrolling state, attacking state, etc. However, the <b>Smile</b> is typically only visible when in close proximity to a player. The distance at which the <b>Smile</b> can be seen varies depending on the interior. \n</p><p>The <b>Smile</b> also moves significantly slower than the Coil-Head, barely keeping the same pace as players sprinting at around 50lbs while chasing them. The time it takes for the <b>Smile</b> to deactivate while actively moving towards a player is increased to around 30 seconds to compensate.\n</p><p>If the <b>Smile</b> is not currently being observed and comes into contact with a player, they will rapidly take 90 damage per hit. Any player that dies to the <b>Smile</b> will have their head pop off and replaced by a coil.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Spawn_Chances\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Spawn_Chances\">&gt; Spawn Chances</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Smile</b> can naturally spawn on several moons, most commonly spawning within the interior of <a href=\"/wiki/Filitrios\" title=\"Filitrios\"><b>Filitrios</b></a>. \n</p>\n<div class=\"noresize\">\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Moon Name</th>\n<th>Interior or Exterior</th>\n<th>Spawn Chance\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Filitrios\" title=\"Filitrios\">Filitrios</a></td>\n<td>Interior</td>\n<td>27.00%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Carnate\" title=\"Carnate\">Carnate</a></td>\n<td>Interior</td>\n<td>17.37%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Fission-C\" title=\"Fission-C\">Fission-C</a></td>\n<td>Interior</td>\n<td>8.73%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://lethal.miraheze.org/wiki/Titan\">Titan</a></td>\n<td>Interior</td>\n<td>5.13%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Acidir\" title=\"Acidir\">Acidir</a></td>\n<td>Interior</td>\n<td>2.56%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Xenphir\" title=\"Xenphir\">Xenphir</a></td>\n<td>Interior</td>\n<td>1.62%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Utril\" title=\"Utril\">Utril</a></td>\n<td>Interior</td>\n<td>1.57%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Cosmocos\" title=\"Cosmocos\">Cosmocos</a></td>\n<td>Interior</td>\n<td>1.28%\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Bestiary_Entry\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Bestiary_Entry\">&gt; Bestiary Entry</span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" data-expandtext=\"\u25bc\" data-collapsetext=\"\u25b2\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Smile <span style=\"padding-left:0.5em;\">&#x2060;</span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<table style=\"border: 15px solid #8E8E83; font-size: 135%; font-family: Tomorrow; color: #01A801; border-spacing: 0px;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 25px; background-color: #151515;\">SMILE<br /><br />It smiles<br />Smile<br />I smile<br />I laugh<br />It stares<br />It smiles<br />Smile<br />I smile<br />I laugh<br />It stares<br />It smiles<br />Smile<br />I smile<br />I laugh<br />It stares<br />It smiles<br />Smile<br />I smile<br />I look<br />It stares<br />It smiles<br />Smile<br />I feel<br />I see<br />It stares<br />It smiles<br />Smile<br />I feel watched<br />It keeps staring<br />It keeps smiling<br />Smile<br />They\u2019re here<br />I feel safe<br />It\u2019s gone<br />But I still feel it<br />Smile\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Audio\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Audio\">&gt; Audio</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noresize\">\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" style=\"text-align: center;\" data-expandtext=\"\u25bc\" data-collapsetext=\"\u25b2\">\n<caption style=\"white-space: nowrap;\">Audio\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Action</th>\n<th>Sound\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Patrolling</td>\n<td><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"3\" data-mwtitle=\"SmilePatrol.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/SmilePatrol.mp3?381d5d\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/SmilePatrol.mp3/SmilePatrol.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Attacking</td>\n<td><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"2\" data-mwtitle=\"SmileAttack.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/SmileAttack.mp3?7a5b6a\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/SmileAttack.mp3/SmileAttack.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Stopping</td>\n<td><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"2\" data-mwtitle=\"DiscmanStop1.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/DiscmanStop1.mp3?5238c3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/DiscmanStop1.mp3/DiscmanStop1.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio><br /><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"3\" data-mwtitle=\"DiscmanStop2.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/DiscmanStop2.mp3?a6d130\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/DiscmanStop2.mp3/DiscmanStop2.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio><br /><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"3\" data-mwtitle=\"DiscmanStop3.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/DiscmanStop3.mp3?e6c03f\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/DiscmanStop3.mp3/DiscmanStop3.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Deactivating</td>\n<td><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"5\" data-mwtitle=\"DiscmanStop.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/DiscmanStop.mp3?c390b8\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/DiscmanStop.mp3/DiscmanStop.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Trivia\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Trivia\">&gt; Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>The <b>Smile</b> is the only <b>Ememy Variant</b> that is part of a vanilla moon's spawn table, having a weight of 33 and a 5.13% chance to spawn within the interior of <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://lethal.miraheze.org/wiki/Titan\">Titan</a>.</li></ul>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Gallery\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Gallery\">&gt; Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-traditional\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:SmileInDark.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"The Smile in the dark.\"><img alt=\"The Smile in the dark.\" src=\"/images/thumb/SmileInDark.jpg/120px-SmileInDark.jpg?cd98bb\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/SmileInDark.jpg/180px-SmileInDark.jpg?cd98bb 1.5x, /images/thumb/SmileInDark.jpg/240px-SmileInDark.jpg?cd98bb 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">The Smile in the dark.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:SmileCarnival.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"The Smile in a crystal ball room found in the Carnival.\"><img alt=\"The Smile in a crystal ball room found in the Carnival.\" src=\"/images/thumb/SmileCarnival.jpg/120px-SmileCarnival.jpg?8fbce3\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/SmileCarnival.jpg/180px-SmileCarnival.jpg?8fbce3 1.5x, /images/thumb/SmileCarnival.jpg/240px-SmileCarnival.jpg?8fbce3 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">The Smile in a crystal ball room found in the Carnival.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:SmileDeactivated.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"Smile after deactivating.\"><img alt=\"Smile after deactivating.\" src=\"/images/thumb/SmileDeactivated.jpg/120px-SmileDeactivated.jpg?d14dce\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/SmileDeactivated.jpg/180px-SmileDeactivated.jpg?d14dce 1.5x, /images/thumb/SmileDeactivated.jpg/240px-SmileDeactivated.jpg?d14dce 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Smile after deactivating.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n</ul></div>", "images": ["Smile.jpg", "SmileInDark.jpg", "SmileCarnival.jpg", "SmileDeactivated.jpg", "SmilePatrol.mp3", "SmileAttack.mp3", "DiscmanStop1.mp3", "DiscmanStop2.mp3", "DiscmanStop3.mp3", "DiscmanStop.mp3"], "cats": ["Pages_with_DRUID_infoboxes"]}